### 1. تسجيل المدير (Admin)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ahmad",
  "lastName": "Admin",
  "phoneNo": "0790000001",
  "email": "admin@clinic.com",
  "username": "admin123",
  "password": "password123",
  "role_id": 1
}

### 2. تسجيل الدكتور (Doctor)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ahmad",
  "lastName": "Doctor",
  "phoneNo": "0790000002",
  "email": "doctor@clinic.com",
  "username": "doctor_ahmad",
  "password": "password123",
  "role_id": 2
}

### 3. تسجيل موظف الاستقبال (Receptionist)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Khaled",
  "lastName": "Rec",
  "phoneNo": "0790000003",
  "email": "reception@clinic.com",
  "username": "khaled_rec",
  "password": "password123",
  "role_id": 3
}

### تسجيل الدخول
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "khaled_rec",
  "password": "password123"
}

